SOLUTION 1 DIC
    temp 20
    units mmol/kgw
    pH 7 charge
    C(4) 50
SOLUTION 2 Ca
    temp 20
    units mmol/kgw
    pH 7 charge
    Ca 50
MIX 1
    1 1
    2 1
USE mix 1
